    "body": "Thank you for raising this. It's equivalent to:\r\n\r\n> If one of the following is true:\r\n> \r\n> * parent has an element child\r\n> * child is a doctype\r\n> * child is non-null and a doctype is following child\r\n\r\nand I think it works due to our consistent usage of Oxford commas, but writing it as a list would be a lot clearer and we should do so.",
