    "created_at": "2020-06-11T18:09:53Z",
    "updated_at": "2020-06-11T18:10:24Z",
    "body": "On that front there's https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/ (and somewhat less helpful https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/introduction.html#how-to-read-this-specification), but neither of them go into this specifically.\r\n\r\nAt a higher level we have https://whatwg.org/style-guide, though that's more a guide for editors than for readers.\r\n\r\nBut we have rewritten phrases like this before to use lists so I think it's fair to keep this open.",
